<header><div class="eyebrow">✝ &nbsp; A moment of prayer</div><h1>Pray the Rosary</h1><p>One bead. One prayer. One peaceful step at a time.</p></header>
<main>
<section class="toolbar panel"><div><label for="mysterySet">Choose your mysteries</label><select id="mysterySet"><option value="joyful">Joyful · Monday & Saturday</option><option value="sorrowful">Sorrowful · Tuesday & Friday</option><option value="glorious">Glorious · Wednesday & Sunday</option><option value="luminous">Luminous · Thursday</option></select></div><button id="reset" class="reset">Start from beginning</button></section>
<div class="content">
<section class="panel visual" aria-label="Interactive rosary diagram"><h2>Follow the light. Hold what glows.</h2><p>Move through each prayer, one wooden bead at a time.</p><svg id="rosaryGraphic" viewBox="0 0 440 630" role="img" aria-label="Full rosary with current bead illuminated"></svg><div id="beadStatus" class="beading" aria-live="polite">Crucifix</div></section>
<section class="panel guide" aria-live="polite"><div class="progress-top"><span id="progressLabel">Step 1</span><span id="percent">0%</span></div><div class="track"><div class="fill" id="progressBar"></div></div><div class="hold" id="location">Hold the crucifix</div><h2 id="heading">Sign of the Cross</h2><p id="prayer" class="prayer"></p><p id="reflection" class="note" hidden></p><p id="tip" class="note" hidden></p><div class="actions"><button id="back" type="button">← Back</button><button id="next" type="button">Next →</button></div></section>
</div>
<details class="panel"><summary>How do I pray with the beads?</summary><p>Start at the crucifix, then the first large bead and the three small beads. After the introductory prayers, announce each mystery before its large bead. Each decade has one Our Father on a large bead and ten Hail Marys on the small beads. After the tenth small bead, say the Glory Be and optionally the Fatima Prayer. End with the Hail Holy Queen and closing prayer.</p></details>
<details class="panel"><summary>All 20 mysteries</summary><div id="allMysteries"></div></details>
<details class="panel"><summary>Help with older prayer words</summary><p><b>Thy</b> (th-eye): your · <b>Thee</b> (thee): you · <b>Thou</b> (th-ow): you · <b>Hallowed</b> (HAL-ohd): holy · <b>Trespasses</b> (TRESS-puh-siz): wrongs · <b>Beseech</b> (bih-SEECH): earnestly ask.</p></details>
<footer>Your place is saved on this device. Take your time and pray at your own pace.</footer>
<p class="art-credit">Your crucifix is embedded directly in this page, so it displays even without internet.</p>
